      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHARLI BROWN (12) has been most impressive of late and he made it two in a row when successful at his latest appearance over 1609m at this track, getting home by a nose. Hard to know where he gets from this slightly awkward draw but finds a nice race and can chalk-up the hat-trick. WICKED WINDERMERE (4) has been racing well of late. Finished fourth at his latest appearance over 1177m at Pinjarra, beaten 3.5 metres. Has the ability to find the winners' list. AKABAH (11) is next best after finishing third when resuming over 2116m at Pinjarra last time out. Strips fitter now. WRITE RITE RIGHT (6) has been about the mark of late and must be respected, the latest offering a sound fifth at Northam over 2190m. Top-three aspirations.",
